-- SENZY HUB | OUWLAND / SLAYER 2
-- Integrated from the two user-supplied files. Run this file as one script.
-- Original tabs: Main, Auto Farm, Quests, TELEPORT, Dungeon, Settings.
-- Toggle UI: RightControl. Mobile: floating button and hamburger sidebar.
-- Mobile fit revision: safe-area layout, portrait/landscape resizing, bounded drag, overlay sidebar.
-- Settings contains accent colour, keybind, notifications and original config controls.
-- Profiles: SenzyHubConfigs/Ouwland/<PlaceId>/auto.json
-- 263 original non-bootstrap function bodies are preserved without modification.
-- Validation scope: syntax plus mocked UI/callback/config integration.
-- Live Roblox/game-server behaviour must still be verified in the original environment.
-- The original internal SymbiosOuwland keys remain for backend compatibility.

